{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And the priest sees it on the seventh day.</b> He does not wait seven full days, to teach you that a partial day counts as the whole." "<b>It has stood in its appearance.</b> If it spread and then dimmed, or dimmed and then spread — it is as though it did not dim." "<b>Seven days a second time.</b> It counts toward both the first week and the second."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:11:39.800194644Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}